Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.68,1:05:16.88,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}只要轉一圈 就在你身邊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.76,1:05:23.19,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}時間是螺旋的階梯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.90,1:05:28.89,theme_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be1}連接著離別
