Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.40,op_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}多好的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.38,op_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}我要是能辦到該多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:59.28,op_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}那樣的梦 這樣的梦 有好多好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:01.37,op_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}一個一個一個地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.38,0:02:03.34,op_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}全部都能實現
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:09.30,op_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}用那不可思議的小口袋 為我實現
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:13.21,op_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}好想自由地 在天空飛翔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:17.22,op_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}「給你！這是竹蜻蜓」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:19.23,op_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}AN AN AN
